OL,3,AReform councillor quits over offensive
OL,4,Aremarks
OL,5,
OL,6,FFeeney said he had resigned every post
OL,7,Fhe held on Solihull Council and
OL,8,FBirmingham City Council, adding that
OL,9,Fhis remarks "were wrong, offensive and
OL,10,Fcompletely unacceptable".
